**What I learned:** 

openssl s_client is a testing tool. It was designed for:
	•	debugging
	•	checking certificates
	•	testing secure services
Some services:
	•	talk after you finish
	•	send data slowly
	•	wait before replying

-ign_eof = stay connected no matter what (used in cases where the connection is ended before the server can respond back to message you sent)
